UniversalRewardsDistributor::claim
├── when contract is paused
│   └── it should revert with PausablePaused
├── when sender is not authorized to act on behalf of onBehalf
│   └── it should revert with RewardsDistributorUnauthorized
├── when merkle proof is invalid
│   ├── given merkle root is set to another nonzero root
│   │   └── it should revert with RewardsDistributorInvalidInput
│   ├── given proof does not verify against merkle root
│   │   └── it should revert with RewardsDistributorInvalidInput
│   └── given leaf data does not match provided parameters
│       └── it should revert with RewardsDistributorInvalidInput
├── when user has already claimed the full amount
│   ├── given claimed amount equals totalRewardTokenAssignedToUser
│   │   └── it should revert with RewardsDistributorInvalidInput
│   └── given claimed amount exceeds totalRewardTokenAssignedToUser
│       └── it should revert with RewardsDistributorInvalidInput
└── when all conditions are met for valid claim
    ├── when user has never claimed before
    │   ├── it should transfer full totalRewardTokenAssignedToUser amount
    │   ├── it should update claimed mapping to totalRewardTokenAssignedToUser
    │   ├── it should emit ClaimRewardToken event
    │   └── it should return the claimed amount
    ├── when user has partially claimed before
    │   ├── it should transfer remaining unclaimed amount
    │   ├── it should update claimed mapping to totalRewardTokenAssignedToUser
    │   ├── it should emit ClaimRewardToken event
    │   └── it should return the newly claimed amount
    └── when sender is authorized but not the onBehalf user
        ├── it should transfer tokens to onBehalf address
        ├── it should update claimed mapping for onBehalf
        ├── it should emit ClaimRewardToken event with correct caller and onBehalf
        └── it should return the claimed amount
